  helpers of the same names in
  models/demos/gpt_oss/tt/fused_decode/kernels/stream_gate_up_compute.cpp
  (SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Tenstorrent USA, Inc.).

- dense_reader/kernels/dense_compute.cpp, moe/kernels/moe_gu_compute.cpp, moe/kernels/moe_dn_compute.cpp,
  int4/kernels/w4a16_compute.cpp, ternary_matmul/kernels/t2_compute.cpp, ternary_matmul/kernels/t2m_compute.cpp:
  their matmul loop (matmul_block over output subblocks, partial sums packed with the packer's L1 accumulation, a
  row-broadcast stage after the matmul) follows
  ttnn/cpp/ttnn/operations/matmul/device/kernels/compute/bmm_large_block_zm_fused_bias_activation.cpp
  (SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2023 Tenstorrent USA, Inc.).

- common/device.py (read_vcs): the assignment of DRAM read virtual channels to worker cores (bank & 3, moved on while
  an earlier core of the same row has it) follows
  ttnn/cpp/ttnn/operations/matmul/device/factory/matmul_multicore_reuse_mcast_dram_sharded_program_factory.cpp
  (SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Tenstorrent USA, Inc.).

- gated_delta/kernels/gdn_compute.cpp, gated_delta/kernels/gdn_ops.h (its tile helpers),
  gated_delta/kernels/gdn_reader.cpp, gated_delta/kernels/gdn_writer.cpp: adapted from the "mono" program of
  tt-metal's chunk_gated_delta_rule op,
  ttnn/cpp/ttnn/operations/transformer/chunk_gated_delta_rule/device/kernels/compute/chunk_gated_delta_rule.cpp,
  .../device/kernels/dataflow/reader_chunk_gated_delta_rule.cpp, chunk_gdn_gate_read.hpp and
  .../device/kernels/dataflow/writer_chunk_gated_delta_rule.cpp
  (SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Tenstorrent USA, Inc.); gated_delta/ORIGINS.md lists the changes.

